---
// Relative redirect defaulting to English (/en/)
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=./en/">
  <script is:inline>
    const currentPath = window.location.pathname.replace(/\/+$/, '');
    window.location.replace(currentPath + '/en/');
  </script>
  <title>Javier Sáez | Redirecting...</title>
</head>
<body style="background-color: #0a0d12; color: #f2e5c8; font-family: sans-serif; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100vh; margin: 0;">
  <p>Redirecting to <a href="./en/" style="color: #d4af37;">Javier Sáez Portfolio</a>...</p>
</body>
</html>
